{"id":51752,"date":"2026-08-26T10:00:00","date_gmt":"2026-08-26T09:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/epic-azores\/"},"modified":"2026-10-19T12:27:50","modified_gmt":"2026-10-19T11:27:50","slug":"epic-azores","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/epic-azores\/","title":{"rendered":"EPIC Azores 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">EPIC Azores 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>EPIC Azores 2026<\/strong> (11\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o do EPIC Trail Run Azores) realiza-se de <strong>3 a 5 de dezembro de 2026<\/strong> (quinta-feira a s\u00e1bado) na deslumbrante <strong>Ilha de S\u00e3o Miguel<\/strong>, na Regi\u00e3o Aut\u00f3noma dos <strong>A\u00e7ores<\/strong>. Tendo como base log\u00edstica e meta central o <strong>Pavilh\u00e3o A\u00e7or Arena<\/strong>, em <strong>Vila Franca do Campo<\/strong> (antiga capital da ilha, fronteira ao ic\u00f3nico Ilh\u00e9u de Vila Franca), esta prova de refer\u00eancia atl\u00e2ntica desafia-te num formato linear non-stop por lagoas vulc\u00e2nicas, floresta laurissilva e arribas costeiras.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Os percursos atravessam cinco concelhos micaelenses \u2014 <strong>Vila Franca do Campo<\/strong>, <strong>Ponta Delgada<\/strong>, <strong>Nordeste<\/strong>, <strong>Ribeira Grande<\/strong> e <strong>Lagoa<\/strong> \u2014 passando por cen\u00e1rios naturais \u00fanicos como o Pico da Vara e a Lagoa do Fogo. O programa competitivo arranca na quinta-feira (3 de dezembro, \u00e0s 22:00 nas Portas da Cidade em Ponta Delgada) com as 100 milhas do <strong>EPIC 100M (167 km \/ 9252m D+)<\/strong>; prossegue na sexta-feira (4 de dezembro, \u00e0s 21:00 na Vila do Nordeste) com o <strong>EPIC 100K (108 km \/ 6128m D+)<\/strong>; e culmina no s\u00e1bado (5 de dezembro) com o <strong>EPIC 60 (63 km \/ 2918m D+)<\/strong> \u00e0s 08:00 na Ribeira Grande, o <strong>EPIC 30 (34 km \/ 1793m D+)<\/strong> \u00e0s 09:30 em \u00c1gua de Pau, o <strong>EPIC 15 (17 km \/ 818m D+)<\/strong> \u00e0s 10:30 na Praia de \u00c1gua d&#8217;Alto, a caminhada <strong>EPIC DayWalk<\/strong> \u00e0s 14:00 e o <strong>EPIC Kids (3 km)<\/strong> \u00e0s 14:30.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizado pelo <strong>Epic Trail Azores<\/strong> com orienta\u00e7\u00e3o t\u00e9cnica da <strong>Ansibikers<\/strong> e certificado pela ITRA, UTMB Index, <strong>ATRP<\/strong> e Circuito de Trail de S\u00e3o Miguel, o evento garante transporte desde o Pavilh\u00e3o A\u00e7or Arena para os locais de partida, geolocaliza\u00e7\u00e3o GPS nos 167 km e 108 km, abastecimentos Pl\u00e1stico Zero, refei\u00e7\u00e3o final, duches e pr\u00e9mio finisher. Consulta o calend\u00e1rio nacional de provas de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Trail Running em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28p